name: bili-tools
version: "0.2.0"
description: "Bilibili tools: 6 read tools (search/info/comments/danmaku/subtitle/download) with explicit implementation=curl|bilibili_api switch (curl default, anonymous, zero-dep); write/login tools gated behind HERMES_BILIBILI_ENABLE_DANGER_FEATURE=1."
author: Feather
kind: standalone
provides_tools:
  - bili_search
  - bili_video_info
  - bili_comments
  - bili_danmaku
  - bili_subtitle
  - bili_download
  - bili_login
  - bili_login_check
  - bili_comment_post
  - bili_danmaku_post
provides_hooks: []
